  hint: Found at a set of stones known as the Cove
  characterDescription: "Sheep\r\nFound at a set of stones known as the Cove\r\nOutfit
    inspired by neolithic people\r\nSasha sheep is an aspiring actress. She has shown
    up as a background actor in many tv shows and films, but has yet to truly break
    into the mainstream. That doesn't matter to her though, she enjoys performing,
    and showing her friends her new roles, much more than any fame.\r"
